.TH SAMPLE-WORKTREE-REMOVE 1
.SH NAME
sample\-worktree\-remove \- Removes worktrees.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample worktree remove\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIstring\fR...]
.br
\fBsample rm\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIstring\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes worktrees.
Their branches stay.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
[\fIstring\fR...]
The worktrees.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fIstring\fR
Only those idle this long.
Default: 7d.
.TP
\fB\-\-ratio\fR \fIdouble?\fR
The share of files that may differ.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
